    {
      "startTime": "2019-12-07T01:10:00Z",
      "endTime": "2019-12-07T02:00:00Z",
      "duration": "P50M",
      "title": "The new CMS paradox: Coming conflicts in content management",
      "location": "コワーキング",
      "link": "https://drupal-camp2019.den-japan.org/sessions/",
      "track": [
        "Keynote"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "Preston So"
      ],
      "full_description": "Keynote Speech: The new CMS paradox: Coming conflicts in content management\n\nPresented by Preston So, Principal Product Manager at GATSBY (New York), author of \"Decoupled Drupal in Practice.\"\n\nThis keynote covers the emerging paradox in content management systems, including the rise of decoupled and headless CMS architectures, distributed CMS, and the conflicts arising between traditional monolithic CMS approaches and the new generation of API-first, decoupled content management solutions.\n\nSession materials: https://den-japan.org/sites/default/files/den2019presentation/The%20new%20CMS%20paradox_%20Coming%20conflicts%20in%20content%20management%20%28DEN%20Camp%20Nagoya%202019%20keynote%29.pdf",
      "video_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tDvlTuXrbAE",
      "sponsorIds": ""
    },
    {
      "startTime": "2019-12-07T02:10:00Z",
      "endTime": "2019-12-07T02:50:00Z",
      "duration": "P40M",
      "title": "【API、デカップルドをテーマ】にしてのグループトーク　米国・インド・日本 ３か国先端エンジニアによる最新開発手法についてディスカッション",
      "location": "コワーキング",
      "link": "https://drupal-camp2019.den-japan.org/sessions/",
      "track": [
        "Panel Discussion"
      ],
      "speakers": [
        "Preston So",
        "Gautam Das",
        "岸 俊兵",
        "萩原 高行"
      ],
      "full_description": "【API、デカップルドをテーマ】にしてのグループトーク　米国・インド・日本 ３か国先端エンジニアによる最新開発手法についてディスカッション\n\nAPIおよびデカップルドアーキテクチャをテーマに、アメリカ、インド、日本の3か国の先端エンジニアが集まり、最新開発手法についてディスカッション。\n\nパネリスト:\n- Preston So（米国, GATSBY Principal Product Manager）\n- Gautam Das（インド, Generolo）\n- 岸 俊兵（日本, Acquia Japan）\n\nコーディネーター: 萩原 高行",
      "video_url": "",
      "sponsorIds": ""
    },
